@api = http://localhost:5000/api

### Health check
GET {{api}}/health

### Login Super Admin (REST Client menyimpan cookie pada sebagian konfigurasi)
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@marketplace.local","password":"AdminCOD123!"}

### Profil pengguna
GET {{api}}/auth/me

### Daftar pembeli
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Pembeli Baru","email":"pembeli.baru@example.local","password":"SandiPembeli123!","phone":"081234567890"}

### Daftar penjual
POST {{api}}/auth/register-store
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Penjual Baru","email":"penjual.baru@example.local","password":"SandiPenjual123!","phone":"081234567888","storeName":"Toko Contoh Baru","city":"Bandar Lampung","address":"Jalan Contoh Nomor 1","storePhone":"081234567888"}

### Beranda katalog
GET {{api}}/catalog/home

### Cari produk
GET {{api}}/catalog/products?q=&sort=bestseller&page=1&limit=12

### Toko menunggu verifikasi (harus login Super Admin)
GET {{api}}/admin/stores?status=pending

### Persetujuan toko (sesuaikan ID)
PATCH {{api}}/admin/stores/1/approve

### Tambah keranjang (harus login customer)
POST {{api}}/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{"product_id":1,"qty":1}

### Checkout
POST {{api}}/orders/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"note":"Bisa COD sekitar kampus"}

### List pesanan penjual
GET {{api}}/store/orders

### Konfirmasi jadwal COD (admin toko)
PATCH {{api}}/store/orders/1/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"meeting_location":"Depan kampus","meeting_at":"2026-11-07 13:00:00"}

### Konfirmasi lunas (admin toko)
PATCH {{api}}/store/orders/1/paid

### Ringkasan keuangan
GET {{api}}/store/finance/summary?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
